"Hazel Dinah Velra is Aimi Velra's niece and Aulia Velra's favorite descendant."
"She has shoulder-length brown hair, brown eyes and perfect orthodontic teeth."
"She is pretty in a well-kept way, and picks the polish off her nails."
"She is a chaining prodigy with finely attuned senses for certain kinds of magic."
"She is an authorized witness for class trades."
"She was expected to be S-rank but came out a B-rank Rabbit."
"The family had kept an S-rank Chainer lined up for her for two years."
"Her grace period was about to run out when Alden Thorn's B-rank Chainer appeared."
"At Hannah Elber's funeral she traded Rabbit to Alden for Chainer and affixed at once."
"She wore a tailored black dress and heels to the funeral."
"Alden finds her bland and does not like her, but she does not feel uneven to him."
"The Gloss gives her a buzzing in her head near her family."
"She can sense wordchain repercussions, and films herself for social media with a minidrone."
"Alden believes she called in his wordchain debt without asking him."
